# UI & Design System — Quantia Web

## Authority (read first)

1. **`DESIGN.md`** (repo root) — tokens, registered components, layout patterns, DON'Ts. **Read before ANY UI work.**
2. **`.cursor/docs/SCREENS.md`** — screen inventory, routes, roles, composition blueprints.
3. **`.cursorrules`** — locked stack (Styled Components + Radix, no Tailwind/Shadcn CLI).

If a token or component is not in `DESIGN.md`, stop and flag it. Do not invent parallel families.

## Stack reminder

- Radix primitive + Styled Components + theme tokens only.
- Shadcn is a composition reference only — never copy Tailwind classes or run the Shadcn CLI.
- Components live in `src/components/{base,system,composite,page}` and must match Figma/`DESIGN.md` names (`intent`, `size`, `isLoading`).

## Mandatory while building UI

- Map every color, space, radius, type and shadow to a theme token.
- Implement technical → visual states: skeleton, empty, error, 401, 403, 429, sync, socket disconnected.
- Dark mode via tokens only; honor `prefers-reduced-motion`; motion 150/200/250 ms on `transform`/`opacity`.

